  "title": "AGNICO EAGLE UPDATES EARLY WARNING REPORT IN RESPECT OF PRISM RESOURCES INC.",
  "summary": "(NYSE: AEM) (TSX: AEM) (\"Agnico Eagle\") announced today that it has updated its early warning report in respect of Prism Resources Inc. (\"Prism\") in connection with Agnico Eagle entering into a royalty purchase agreement (the \"Royalty Purchase Agreement\") with Prism, pursuant to which Agnico Eagle has agreed to purchase Prism's right, title and interest in and to a 7.5% net profit interest royalty (the \"Royalty\") over certain properties in the Porcupine Mining District of Ontario owned by Agnico",
